{"id":"n68602-1-10","stage":3,"title":"따라오다 · 追来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68602-1-10-1","ko":"할머니, 잠깐 저 가게에 들렀다 가도 돼요?","zh":"奶奶，我可以先去那家店一下再回来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶","explanation":"할머니：奶奶","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"2","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"가게에","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게에","audio":"/audio/dcd7d2a0ec316502a2f3.mp3"}},{"text":"들렀다","meaning":"顺便去一下","explanation":"들르다：顺便去一下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"들르다","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67876","senseId":"1","lemma":"들르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들렀다","audio":"/audio/634582c8484c5da58ee1.mp3"}},{"text":"가도","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","